<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3169] Maven version set is broken</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3169</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I noticed that running&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;mvn versions:set -DprocessDependencies=false -DnewVersion=0.8.0-SNAPSHOT-123 -DgenerateBackupPoms=false
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;we get errors on interpreter-parent module.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;[ERROR]   The project org.apache.zeppelin:zeppelin-elasticsearch:0.8.0-SNAPSHOT (/opt/src/zeppelin/elasticsearch/pom.xml) has 1 error
[ERROR]     Non-resolvable parent POM for org.apache.zeppelin:interpreter-parent:0.8.0-SNAPSHOT: Could not find artifact org.apache.zeppelin:zeppelin:pom:0.8.0-SNAPSHOT and &apos;parent.relativePath&apos; points at wrong local POM @ org.apache.zeppelin:interpreter-parent:0.8.0-SNAPSHOT, /opt/src/zeppelin/interpreter-parent/pom.xml, line 22, column 11 -&amp;gt; [Help 2]
[ERROR]  
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looks to have been a regression introduced on commit 4a3057fa87fbe092&lt;/p&gt;</description>
